{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":2898,"name":"Toufeeq  Pasha","username":"Toufeeq_Pasha","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.availproject.org/toufeeq_pasha/{size}/858_2.png","created_at":"2025-12-23T06:48:37.831Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReport Author\u003c/strong\u003e: Toufeeq from the Avail Technical Committee [5CoVaWrZnaV3BSeUJCA8Ca3SPMJDtjT1zPvZkzovkxJU7dkr]\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eChange Executed\u003c/strong\u003e: Changes will be applied at block \u003cspan class=\"hashtag-raw\"\u003e#2\u003c/span\u003e,329,375\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTechnical Committee Consensus\u003c/strong\u003e: 4/7 signers \u003ca href=\"https://avail.subscan.io/tech/36?tab=votes\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eSubscan | Aggregate Substrate ecological network high-precision Web3 explorer\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntroduction:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nThis report aims to provide transparency to the Avail community regarding both upcoming and executed network changes. The Avail Technical Committee (TC) has approved a runtime upgrade on Avail Mainnet to decrease the \u003cstrong\u003eideal_stake\u003c/strong\u003e to 50% from the current 75%. After a detailed review of the upgrade’s effectiveness, impact, and security, the TC reached a majority consensus (4/7) to proceed with the changes.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProposed / Executed Changes:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe proposal to increase the \u003cstrong\u003eideal_stake\u003c/strong\u003e to 50% was introduced and discussed in the community through \u003ca href=\"https://forum.availproject.org/t/aip-8-change-ideal-staking-ratio-to-50-and-update-to-foundation-delegation-commission-policy/1742\"\u003eAIP 8\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCode Modifications:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nFor those interested, you can review the necessary code modifications in the following PR:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://github.com/availproject/avail/pull/793\"\u003ePR1\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePotential Merits to the Network:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe change to the \u003cstrong\u003eideal_stake\u003c/strong\u003e parameter is applied via a runtime upgrade and does not affect the consensus mechanism or validator operations. The network will continue to function as intended, with no disruptions for participants. This upgrade ensures validator operator sustainability and ensures a well-incentivised validator set as the network continues to grow.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you require any additional resources or information, please feel free to drop comments.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThank you.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2025-12-23T06:48:37.831Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":7,"reads":16,"readers_count":15,"score":68.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":1743,"topic_slug":"transparency-report-19-change-ideal-stake-to-50","display_username":"Toufeeq  Pasha","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://forum.availproject.org/t/aip-8-change-ideal-staking-ratio-to-50-and-update-to-foundation-delegation-commission-policy/1742","internal":true,"reflection":false,"title":"AIP 8: Change Ideal Staking Ratio to 50% and Update to Foundation Delegation Commission Policy","clicks":5},{"url":"https://github.com/availproject/avail/pull/793","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Change ideal_staking ratio to 50% by ToufeeqP · Pull Request #793 · availproject/avail · GitHub","clicks":1},{"url":"https://avail.subscan.io/tech/36?tab=votes","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Subscan | Aggregate Substrate ecological network high-precision Web3 explorer","clicks":1}],"read":true,"user_title":"Avail Technical Committee","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":2}],"moderator":true,"admin":false,"staff":true,"user_id":999,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/transparency-report-19-change-ideal-stake-to-50/1743/1","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":2}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":2,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":2899,"name":"Minsu Kim","username":"Hans_DeSpread","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.availproject.org/hans_despread/{size}/980_2.png","created_at":"2025-12-24T04:56:22.593Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eWe welcome the decision to adjust ideal_stake to 50%.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis change aligns well with Avail’s goal of fostering a decentralized and sustainable validator ecosystem.\u003cbr\u003e\nBy reducing stake concentration pressure, it allows committed validators who actively contribute to the network and community to remain competitive and sustainable over the long term.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe support the proposal and appreciate it.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":2,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2025-12-24T04:56:22.593Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":15,"readers_count":14,"score":18.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":1743,"topic_slug":"transparency-report-19-change-ideal-stake-to-50","display_username":"Minsu Kim","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delet